00:02:01.306 --> 00:02:03.483
That is actually true. But I just hard coded it.

00:02:03.483 --> 00:02:06.373
So now, let's figure out how to make a web request.

00:02:06.373 --> 00:02:10.758
I'm not quite sure what's installed. So, let's just try to import requests and see what happens.

00:02:10.758 --> 00:02:14.156
When I run it this time, I get an import error. So, request is not installed.

00:02:14.156 --> 00:02:18.720
